013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-07T13:56:21-08:00","id":1013962,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1013865-secrets-of-the-covenants?p=1013960#post1013960\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's mentioned in several sections but also the Invictus one.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's so weird. Are the undead really plugged into the craft beer scene and Comic Con or what?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-07T14:02:27-08:00","id":1013966,"title":"","content":"I liked the Ordo section, and some of the implications in there.<br /> <br /> I'm mildly annoyed that in the mechanics section, the Coil of Zirnitra wasn't clarified at all, for instance how it talks about wolf-blooded despite only allowing purchase of supernatural merits, and grafting unholy flesh not being entirely clear on what you can get with it. I still plan to use it regardless, of course.<br /> <br /> On the other hand, I like the additions and changes to the Cruac styles.<br /> <br /> EDIT: Oh and also love Themes being added next to the rituals for compatibility there (even if the provided levels are somewhat suspect in some cases).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=259490\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/themes/stvault/images/affiliatebanner4.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Christopher%20Falco&amp;affiliate_id=259490\" target=\"_blank\">Storytellers' Vault supplements (WoD, CoD)</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/FalconianP\" target=\"_blank\">My Patreon! (CofD bonuses include: Fae Sorcery/Technomancy for Vampires, Quick Conversion for Inferno, and more!)</a>","edited":{"userid":1130,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1130-falco1029","user":"falco1029","date":". 12-07-2016, 05:07 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1130-falco1029","name":"falco1029","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1130_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1045"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-07T14:04:19-08:00","id":1013969,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1013865-secrets-of-the-covenants?p=1013962#post1013962\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That's so weird. Are the undead really plugged into the craft beer scene and Comic Con or what?</div> </div> </div> </div>No mention of comics. The entry I read was a vampire planning a commercial for the San Diego Citizen's Union to manipulate the masses and inspire the formation of a militia. There's a lot more to it but it looks like they're doing a heavy political steamroll on the place. I'm still reading the Circle of the Crone section.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-07T14:04:33-08:00","id":1013970,"title":"","content":"I still need to read the fluff, though the little bit I skimmed of the Crone's was pretty awesome. Blood Sorcery compatibility on the rituals is very appreciated. Courtoisie merit continues to bug me, feels like it partially invalidates traditional weaponry/melee focused characters. I say partially because you can't really use the 2nd dot in a surprise round.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11516-forgelineage","name":"ForgeLineage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11516_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-07T15:14:31-08:00","id":1013994,"title":"","content":"So how high a percentage of the book's pages are dedicated to fiction?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/904596-geniuses-and-gramarie\" target=\"_blank\">Genius templates</a>: Super Science Mini-Template for De